      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_5",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/drakes-engage-fleet.webp"),
            text: _("With the arrival of Flight Gorlack, all remnant foes were vanquished. A proud eyrie was carved into the highest peak of the three isles. The small flight easily filled their bellies with the captured provisions, leaving the isle’s game to regrow itself for sake of the visitor flights to come. Resha’s patrols spied vague details of the mysterious Greatland."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_6",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Then, only a moon cycle after, a flight was spotted inbound. It was the Flight of Karron."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_7",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("They had arrived far too early..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "loyal_8",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            units: "Gorlack,Resha,Arinexis,Zedrix,Karron,u_1,u_2,u_3",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "objectives",
        side: 1,
        victory: _(""),
