            kill: "yes",
            side: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "se",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 9,
            y: 15,
            item_name: "",
            image: "scenery%2Ftemple1.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 10,
            y: 17,
            item_name: "",
            image: "scenery%2Ftemple1.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 11,
            y: 13,
            item_name: "",
            image: "scenery%2Ftemple1.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 20,
            y: 1,
            item_name: "",
            image: "scenery%2Fwhirlpool.png",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_3",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Karron, you did not wait for my summons!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("You left no prospect of waiting. Upon your departure, the rogues began probing the Domain of Vladnir. Without your flight there would be not enough of us to hold against them. Vladnir counseled me here. So the youths you bestowed me I traded to other flights, for prime drakes able to make the journey."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Vladnir will not last with <b>no</b> ally by his side."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Vladnir is to follow me here. By now he is already faring."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("We have not yet the provisions for three flights within this domain. There could be hunger before the next moon!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Gorlack we must— Gorlack, hatchlings do not belong at a counsel gathering."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("We are <b>not</b> hatchlings..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Not hatchlings!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("Indeed, I am our clan’s elder. Sssuch longevity wandering ssstars bestow me. For over 11 years have I lived."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("They are ‘saurians’."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Their likeness to hatchlings is disarming. Disturbingly so. I do not want them near my fli—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Enough."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("I shall have a closer survey of the Greatland focused on game abundance. Resha, see to it at once."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("By your will."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Resha",
            x: 32,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:put_to_recall_list",
            id: "Resha",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22put_to_recall_list%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Resha%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            heal: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Gorlack, arriving here, I noticed a large gathering of game to the northeast. A nest of haldric."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zedrix",
            text: _("You sssaw Demon King?! You sssssaw <b>The Haldric</b>?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Gorlack, your hatchling-things cry nonsense. You must gain control over them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Not nonsssenssse! Creatures you sssaw call themssselves ‘humans’. They are lumbering, brutish, odiousss monsssters covered in moissst ssskin of toad. They are hirelings sssummoned from underssside of world by elves of deep, dark Foressst of Wesssmere. These humans ssslaughtered all but my entire clan! On the ruins of my hatchplace they raised their towering Fort Elenssse. Pray dragons, rain jussst fire down upon these abominations!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Gorlack, we should harvest them. There is meat enough there to feed our three flights a full year."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Resha has advised against further encounters with humans until more is known of them. Many glider Memories speak of times when underestimated prey became the hunter. Also that this Greatland hides terrible danger."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("You speak with Resha’s fearful tongue. I remember, long ago..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("You would speak of our great battles to be won over the rogues. Hunting beasts so terrible we could only hope to take them on working together. Long ago. Before Resha. Before your mind echoed with her glider myths."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Not myths, Karron. Look around us. It is not the ocean we stand upon."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Your dreams of glorious feats, spoken in such detail. Such certainty. In them I found my inspiration. I would become your first intendant. So that I might become a part of them— your adventures to come. Harder than your other allies I trained. In the challenges, fiercer than any of them I fought. Already advanced to warrior rank was I, when still of basic rank were both of you... When you promised first intendancy to Resha. The insult of second... to me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("You dwell so much in the past. The past weakens you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("It is for this present moment that I recall the past! I adjure you, remember your <b>fire</b> for those dreams of glory! The gift of your caste that once burned brightest in your heart!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Gorlack... look across this narrow sea before us. Look to that ‘human’ legion which faces you. Those creatures which ward the threshold to the greatest land..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Dominant Gorlack, pray tell what glorious dream you see."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
